<%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>

<main class="minor-page terms-page">

    <div class="minor-page-container">

        <div class="minor-page-header">
            <span class="minor-page-eyebrow">TERMS & CONDITIONS</span>
            <h1 class="minor-page-title">
                The little details<br>
                behind every order.
            </h1>
            <p class="minor-page-intro">These Terms & Conditions explain the rules that apply when you use Crumbelle, create an account, 
                browse our products, or place an order through our website.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- intro  -->
        <section class="minor-page-section terms-intro">
            <div class="terms-intro-content">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">PLEASE READ</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">A few things worth knowing before you order.</h2>
                <p>By accessing or using the Crumbelle website, you agree to follow these Terms & Conditions and any applicable
                    policies referenced on the website.
                </p>
                <p>These terms apply to your use of the website, your Crumbelle account, and purchases made through our online store.</p>
                <span class="terms-updated">
                    Last updated:
                    <%= new Date().toLocaleString('en-IN', { month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %>
                </span>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">

            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">USING CRUMBELLE</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Using the website responsibly.</h2>
            </div>
            
            <div class="terms-list">

                <div class="terms-item">
                    <span class="terms-item-number">01</span>
                    <div class="terms-item-content">
                        <h3>Account information</h3>
                        <p>If you create an account, you are responsible for providing accurate information and for keeping your
                            account credentials reasonably secure.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-item">
                    <span class="terms-item-number">02</span>
                    <div class="terms-item-content">
                        <h3>Accurate details</h3>
                        <p>Information provided while creating an account, placing an order, or contacting us should be accurate and 
                            complete so that we can provide the requested service.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-item">
                    <span class="terms-item-number">03</span>
                    <div class="terms-item-content">
                        <h3>Lawful use</h3>
                        <p>You must not use the website for unlawful purposes, to interfere with its operation, or to attempt
                            unauthorized access to accounts, systems, or data.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-item">
                    <span class="terms-item-number">04</span>
                    <div class="terms-item-content">
                        <h3>Account security</h3>
                        <p>Please contact us promptly if you believe your account has been accessed or used without your authorization.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">

            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">PRODUCTS</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">About our products and listings.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <p>We make reasonable efforts to present product descriptions, images, prices, weights, and other product information
                    accurately. However, minor differences in appearance, colour, decoration, or presentation may occur, particularly
                    with handmade or freshly prepared products.
                </p>
                <p>Product availability may change from time to time. Displaying a product on the website does not necessarily
                    guarantee that it will remain available when you complete your purchase.
                </p>
                <p>Where an ingredient, allergen, dietary characteristic, weight, or other product detail is important to your purchase 
                    decision, please review the information provided for that product and contact us when further clarification is needed.
                </p>
            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">

            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">ORDERS & PRICING</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Placing and paying for an order.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="terms-numbered-grid">

                <div class="terms-numbered-card">
                    <span class="terms-card-number">01</span>
                    <h3>Product prices</h3>
                    <p>Prices displayed on the website are the prices applicable at the time of purchase, subject to any clearly stated 
                        taxes, delivery charges, or other applicable fees.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-numbered-card">
                    <span class="terms-card-number">02</span>
                    <h3>Order acceptance</h3>
                    <p>An order is subject to successful submission and acceptance through the website. We may contact you if there is 
                        an issue affecting the order.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-numbered-card">
                    <span class="terms-card-number">03</span>
                    <h3>Payment</h3>
                    <p>Available payment methods are shown at checkout. You agree to provide the information required to complete your 
                        selected payment method.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-numbered-card">
                    <span class="terms-card-number">04</span>
                    <h3>Order confirmation</h3>
                    <p>After a successful order, you will receive or be shown confirmation details such as your order number and order total.</p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="terms-highlight">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">DELIVERY</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Every order has a journey.</h2>
                <p>Delivery availability, charges, preparation times, and estimated delivery information are presented through
                    the website where applicable.
                </p>
                <p>Delivery times may vary depending on your location, product selection, preparation requirements, and other
                    circumstances affecting the delivery process.
                </p>
                <a href="/shipping-delivery" class="terms-inline-link">
                    View Shipping & Delivery
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">CANCELLATIONS</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Need to change your order?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <p>Please contact us as soon as possible if you need to cancel or change an order.</p>
                <p>Because bakery products may begin preparation shortly after an order is placed, cancellation or modification
                    may not always be possible once preparation has started.
                </p>
                <p>Any cancellation, refund, or other resolution will be handled in accordance with the applicable Crumbelle
                    policy and applicable law.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="terms-highlight">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">RETURNS & REFUNDS</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Something isn't right?</h2>
                <p>Bakery products may be subject to specific return and refund conditions because they are prepared for consumption.
                    Issues involving damaged, incorrect, or otherwise affected orders should be reported promptly.
                </p>
                <p>Please refer to our Returns & Refunds page for the applicable process and information.</p>
                <a href="/returns-refunds" class="terms-inline-link">
                    View Returns & Refunds
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- intellectual property -->
        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">WEBSITE CONTENT</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Our content and brand.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <p>Unless otherwise stated, the Crumbelle website and its content, including branding, logos, graphics, photographs,
                    written content, design elements, and original materials, are owned by or used by Crumbelle with appropriate rights.
                </p>
                <p>You may access the website for personal and lawful use. You should not copy, reproduce, distribute, modify, or
                    commercially exploit Crumbelle content without appropriate permission.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">THIRD-PARTY SERVICES</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Some parts of the experience may rely on others.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <p>Certain website functions may depend on third-party services, such as payment processing, hosting, communications, 
                    delivery, or other technical services.
                </p>
                <p>Those services may have their own terms, conditions, and privacy practices. Where applicable, their use may also be 
                    subject to those third-party terms.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">WEBSITE AVAILABILITY</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Things don't always go perfectly online.</h2>
                <p>We aim to keep Crumbelle available and functioning properly, but temporary interruptions may occur because of maintenance,
                    technical problems, network issues, or circumstances outside our reasonable control.
                </p>
                <p>We may also update, modify, suspend, or discontinue parts of the website or its features from time to time.</p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">IMPORTANT</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Applicable rights remain protected.</h2>
                <p>Nothing in these Terms & Conditions is intended to exclude, restrict, or replace any consumer right, remedy, protection,
                    or requirement that cannot lawfully be excluded or restricted under applicable law.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">UPDATES</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">These terms may change.</h2>
                <p>We may update these Terms & Conditions when our services, website features, business practices, or applicable
                    requirements change.
                </p>
                <p>Updated terms will be published on this page together with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-section terms-section">
            <div class="terms-text-block">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">APPLICABLE LAW</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">The rules that apply.</h2>
                <p>These Terms & Conditions are intended to be read together with applicable laws and regulations governing the services
                    and transactions carried out through the Crumbelle website.
                </p>
                <p>Where a dispute or legal issue arises, applicable law and the jurisdiction prescribed by law will determine the
                    available rights, remedies, and forum.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="minor-page-closing terms-closing">
            <span class="minor-page-closing-eyebrow">HAVE A QUESTION?</span>
            <h2>Need clarification?</h2>
            <p>If you have a question about these terms, your order, or anything else related to Crumbelle, we're happy to help.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="minor-page-primary-button">
                Contact Us
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
        </section>

    </div>

</main>

<%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>